OL,4,CFormer first ministers 'disappointed'  
OL,5,Cby PM's devolution calls rejection     
OL,6,GTwo former Labour first ministers have 
OL,7,Gexpressed their disappointment at the  
OL,8,Gdecision by the prime minister not to  
OL,9,Gdevolve further powers to the Senedd.  
OL,11,FMark Drakeford and Carwyn Jones were   
OL,12,Fresponding to the confirmation that    
OL,13,Fcontrol over policing and criminal     
OL,14,Fjustice, rail infrastructure and the   
OL,15,Fcrown estate would be retained at      
OL,16,FWestminster rather than passed on to   
OL,17,FCardiff.                               
OL,19,FIn a letter to First Minister Rhun ap  
OL,20,FIorwerth, Andy Burnham said he had not 
OL,21,Fbeen persuaded by the case for further 
OL,22,Fdevolution in those areas.        G3/4 
