OL,4,CJoanna Page says she nearly messed up  
OL,5,CGavin and Stacey audition              
OL,6,GJoanna Page has said she nearly messed 
OL,7,Gup her Gavin And Stacey audition after 
OL,8,Gfailing to do a Cardiff accent.        
OL,10,FThe 49-year-old rose to fame after     
OL,11,Fstarring as Stacey in the BBC comedy   
OL,12,Fopposite creators James Corden and     
OL,13,FRuth Jones.                            
OL,15,FPage, from Swansea, told campmates on  
OL,16,FITV's I'm A Celebrity... Get Me Out Of 
OL,17,FHere! that she had initially read some 
OL,18,Fscenes for Jones using her actual      
OL,19,Faccent.                                
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
